    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "MUnG7",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Settings / Brief",
      "width": 640,
      "fill": "$surface-raised",
      "cornerRadius": 16,
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wYr7L",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Settings, user tabs — brief",
          "fontFamily": "$font-heading",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MCILO",
          "name": "1 Purpose",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1 Purpose",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HMKsS",
          "name": "1 Purpose body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One route, /settings, holds six user tabs and four admin tabs. This band draws the user tabs: profile, security (password, linked accounts, account deletion), billing, Drive integration, API keys and appearance.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qElEz",
          "name": "2 Entry points",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2 Entry points",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "u3lVXL",
          "name": "2 Entry points body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "/settings?tab=<id>, default profile. OAuth callbacks land on tab=security (linked, link_error) and tab=integrations (drive). /admin/* redirects to the admin tabs. AppShell wraps it: header, content up to 1600 px, footer.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H98Ip",
          "name": "3 Screens",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3 Screens",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AAJK0",
          "name": "3 Screens body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Profile · Security · Security / Delete account · Billing · Integrations / Drive not connected and connected · API keys list, create form and key created · Preferences. Base frame 1280×800; long pages fit their content. Light theme, signed in as Admin User, so the Admin section shows in the nav.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IrtQm",
          "name": "4 Business rules",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4 Business rules",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uz1a2",
          "name": "4 Business rules body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Name max 100, password min 8. A linked account cannot be disconnected when it is the only sign-in method. Deleting an account needs the password and no owned shared workspace (409 lists them). An API key is shown once, has an optional expiry, and a user has a server-side cap of active keys.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "njntZ",
          "name": "5 Copy source",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "5 Copy source",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "OlGSB",
          "name": "5 Copy source body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "pages/Settings.tsx, components/settings/*, ApiKeysSettings, DriveIntegrationCard. Runtime or sample: © 2026, dates, key names and prefixes, “Product Team”, the Admin User and e2e emails from db:seed. Simplified marks: Google as a G, Drive as a feather icon.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "c9bxjz",
          "name": "6 States not drawn",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "6 States not drawn",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "usKaJ",
          "name": "6 States not drawn body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Pending labels, success and error alerts on profile and password, the linked-account state, Drive success and error messages, an empty key list, load failures, dark theme, widths under 1024 px.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sk5Cx",
          "name": "7 Open findings",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "7 Open findings",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PzTph",
          "name": "7 Open findings body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "D30 toggle has no role or name · D32 subtitle and double h1 · D33 silent load failures · D34 revoke without confirmation · D39 empty table head · D40 no responsive layout · D8, D16 (raw green and 10px type on the Drive badge).",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
