          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "/settings?tab=admin-overview | admin-users | admin-site, visible to role admin. The old /admin routes redirect here. The API is guarded by requireAdmin; the tabs themselves are not (D31).",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
