          "content": "pages/AdminDashboard.tsx (AdminOverview), AdminUsers, AdminSettings, IntegrationSecretsPanel, WebhooksPanel. Sample data: metric values, masked secrets, the two seed users. The API metric cards only render when API or MCP activity exists.",
